            <div class="flex flex-col gap-4" data-animate>
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center p-3" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a397c 17%, #191429 105%)">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="width:100%;height:100%"><path d="M10 20l4-16M6.343 17.657l-2.828-2.829a4 4 0 0 1 0-5.656l2.828-2.829M17.657 17.657l2.828-2.829a4 4 0 0 0 0-5.656l-2.828-2.829" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-display font-semibold text-white">Smart Contract Security When Required</h3>
              <p class="text-sd-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">While tokenization is broader than contracts, the underlying logic still needs strong assurance. When the project calls for deeper validation, BlockAudit supports security reviews and remediation before launch.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ⑨ Delivery Approach -->
    <section class="bg-sd-dark py-20 md:py-28 border-t border-white/5">
